 NGN</span></span></a><a href=\"/send-money-from-uae-to-nigeria\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/ae.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:26px;height:18px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"><span style=\"color:#3B2ED3\">→</span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/ng.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:26px;height:18px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"></span><span><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:600\">From UAE</span><span style=\"display:block;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A\">AED → NGN</span></span></a><a href=\"/send-money-from-germany-to-nigeria\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/de.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:26px;height:18px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"><span style=\"color:#3B2ED3\">→</span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/ng.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:26px;height:18px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"></span><span><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:600\">From Germany</span><span style=\"display:block;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A\">EUR → NGN</span></span></a><a href=\"/send-money-from-china-to-nigeria\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><img loading=\"